{"id":"mingecevir-su-anbari","qid":"Q1859076","category":"reservoir","type":"hydronym","names":{"az":"Mingəçevir su anbarı","ru":"Мингечаурское водохранилище","en":"Mingachevir reservoir"},"coordinates":[46.8037,40.9185],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"merkezi-aran","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Mingəçevir su anbarı — Kür çayının Bozdağdan keçdiyi yerdə yaradılmış su anbarı. İnşasına 1945-ci ildə başlanmış Mingəçevir su anbarının və su-elektrik stansiyasının (SES) tikintisi 1953-cü ildə tamamlanmışdır.\nSu anbarının normal dolma səviyyəsində (83 m) ümumi su tutumu 15730 mln. m3, faydalı həcmi isə 8210 mln. m3-dir. Su anbarının çay boyu uzunluğu 70 km, eni 3 km-dən (bənddə) 18 km-ə qədər (Alazan çayı tökülən yerdə) dəyişir.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Мингечевирское водохранилище (устар. Мингечау́рское водохрани́лище; азерб. Mingəçevir su anbarı) — водохранилище в Азербайджане, образовано на реке Кура при строительстве плотины Мингечевирской ГЭС у Мингечевира. Площадь 605 км², объём 16,1 км³, длина 70 км, наибольшая ширина 18 км, средняя глубина 27 м, наибольшая — 75 м. Заполнялось с 1953 по 1959 годы. Высота над уровнем моря — 83 м.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"The Mingachevir Reservoir (Azerbaijani: Mingəçevir su anbarı) (also known as the Mingachevir Sea (Azerbaijani: Mingəçevir dənizi)) is a large reservoir on the Kura river in northwestern Azerbaijan. It supplies water to the Upper Karabakh and Upper Shirvan channels, and is used for electricity generation, irrigation water supply, and fishing.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Mingachevir_Reservoir%2C_Azerbaijan.JPG/960px-Mingachevir_Reservoir%2C_Azerbaijan.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Mingachevir_Reservoir%2C_Azerbaijan.JPG/960px-Mingachevir_Reservoir%2C_Azerbaijan.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":1204,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mingachevir_Reservoir,_Azerbaijan.JPG","title":"Mingachevir Reservoir, Azerbaijan.JPG","artist":"ISS Expedition 23 crew","credit":"NASA Earth Observatory","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":null,"source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q1859076: Mingachevir reservoir","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1859076","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Mingəçevir su anbarı","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Ming%C9%99%C3%A7evir_su_anbar%C4%B1&oldid=9215438","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ming%C9%99%C3%A7evir_su_anbar%C4%B1","revid":9215438,"revDate":"2026-11-22","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Мингечевирское водохранилище","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%9C%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B3%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B5_%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BE%D1%85%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%89%D0%B5&oldid=149238212","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9C%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B3%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B5_%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BE%D1%85%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%89%D0%B5","revid":149238212,"revDate":"2025-10-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Mingachevir reservoir","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mingachevir_reservoir&oldid=1366461590","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mingachevir_reservoir","revid":